    "innovation": "This paper uses climate model simulations to differentiate the effects of insolation and greenhouse gases during the Last Interglacial, demonstrating that insolation drove seasonal/hemispheric patterns while reduced greenhouse gas forcing is crucial for explaining reconstructed North Atlantic cooling and the asynchronous timing of Southern Hemisphere peak warmth.",
